      "url": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DUPqalxEu--/",
      "caption": "Mulki left me with salt in my hair, bruises on my knees, and memories I’ll be holding onto for a long time.\n\nWent there to learn surfing, came back learning how to fall, laugh, and try again. Met new people, shared the best kind of chaos with my closest friends, and lived a few days that felt bigger than they should’ve been. Sore, sunburnt, and completely happy. I’d do it all again.\n.\n.\n.\n.\n.\n[Mulki] [Surf Trip] [Learning to Surf] [Surfing India] [Beach Days] [Salt in My Hair] [Bruised but Happy] [Travel Diaries] [Friends and Waves] [Coastal Karnataka] [Beginner Surfer] [Wipeouts and Laughs] [Sunburnt and Smiling] [Short Trip] [Ocean Therapy]",
